			<!-- point_pknu -->
			<section id="point_section">
				<div id="point-pknu">
					<ul class="wrap_in clear">
						<li>
							<div class="point-ti">Student Programs &<br /><strong>Services</strong></div>
						</li>
						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p02.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>I-Friend <span></span></h3>
								<p>한국 학생들을 만나 자연스럽게 친구가 될 수 있어요.</p>
								<p>Make good Korean friends and have a special friendship.</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p03.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>교환학생<span>Exchange Student</span></h3>
								<p>부경대학교의 해외 자매대학에서 1~2개 학기를 수학하며 학점도 취득해요.</p>
								<p>Study abroad at PKNU's sister universities for 1 or 2 semesters.</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p04.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>문화행사<span>Cutural activities</span></h3>
								<p>캠퍼스를 벗어나 유명한 지역에 가서 한국 문화를 체험해요.</p>
								<p>Experience unique Korean culture outside of campus.</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p05.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>출입국 업무 지원<span>Immigration Affairs</span></h3>
								<p>한국 체류에 필요한 비자 관련 업무를 도와드려요.</p>
								<p>Get help for the  visa related matters.</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p06.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>International Day<span></span></h3>
								<p>한국 친구들에게 자기 나라를 소개해요.</p>
								<p>Introduce your country and culture to Korean friends.</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p07.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>언어교환<span>Language Exchange</span></h3>
								<p>한국 친구들과 서로의 언어를 배워요.</p>
								<p>Exchange languages with  Korean friends.</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p08.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>픽업지원<span>Pick-up Service</span></h3>
								<p>신입생을 위한 공항에서 학교 캠퍼스로 픽업 서비스 제공해요.</p>
								<p>If you are a new student, get a pick-up service at the airport.</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p09.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>보험 가입 지원<span>Insurance</span></h3>
								<p>사고나 질병에 대비하기 위하여 보험 가입을 안내해 드려요.</p>
								<p>OIA has an insurance plan for accident and sickness</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p10.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>통장 개설 지원<span>Banking Service</span></h3>
								<p>한국 체류에 필요한 통장 개설을 도와드려요.</p>
								<p>Get help to open a bank account in Korea.</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p11.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>취업지원<span>Career Support Services</span></h3>
								<p>한국에서 취업을 희망하는 학생을 위해 노하우와 정보를 제공해요.</p>
								<p>Get know-how and information to pursue a career in Korea.</p>
							</div>
						</li>

						<li>
							<figure><img src="/image/p12.jpg" alt=""></figure>
							<div class="hover">
								<h3>상담 프로그램<span>Counseling</span></h3>
								<p>유학생 전담 상담선생님과 외국어로 학업/생활/심리 상담해요.</p>
								<p>Get an advice on your study / Campus life / Self-care from a professional counselor in foreign languages</p>
							</div>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</section>
